# Short links for sharing — Cloudflare Pages redirect rules.
#
# Each line: the short path, where it goes, then 302.
# 302 (temporary) is deliberate: browsers don't cache it, so a short link
# can be repointed at a different event later without anyone being stuck
# on the old destination.
#
# Paste the short form into WhatsApp, a Facebook group, a slide, a card:
#     negotiatelikeawoman.co/w
#
# The tracking is added on arrival and travels through to Luma, so the
# registration shows its true source in Luma's own reporting.

/w    /events/?utm_source=whatsapp&utm_medium=community&utm_campaign=walk_away_webinar_sep_2026            302
/fb   /events/?utm_source=facebook&utm_medium=organic_social&utm_campaign=walk_away_webinar_sep_2026       302

